{% comment %}
@description: Khung bao ngoai moi trang — <head> (title/meta/JSON-LD SEO), goi header/footer, cho block content chen vao giua.
@required_substrings: {% block content %}{% endblock %}, /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/tailwind.js, pageTitle, {% render "header", {% render "footer", {% render "components/common/breadcrumb", {% render "components/common/cart-drawer", /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.css, /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.js
@required_ids:
@notes: BAT BUOC dung <title>{{ pageTitle | default: site.siteName }}</title> - MOI route (blog.ts/pages.ts/products.ts...) tinh rieng pageTitle/metaDescription/noindex/schemas cho tung trang, neu layout chi hardcode site.siteName thi MOI TRANG se co cung 1 title, mat het SEO rieng tung trang (loi that da gap o theme leadbase). PHAI giu <meta name="description"> khi co metaDescription, <meta name="robots" content="noindex"> khi noindex truthy, va vong lap {% for schema in schemas %}<script type="application/ld+json">{{ schema | json }}</script>{% endfor %} (schemas la array object thuong, filter "json" co san trong LiquidJS mac dinh, KHONG can tu dang ky). PHAI dung <script src="/theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/tailwind.js"> (KHONG duoc doi lai <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com">) - tai ban vendor tinh cua Tailwind CDN ve themes/{slug}/assets/tailwind.js (theme moi tu tao thi tu tai tu https://cdn.tailwindcss.com ve, co the them query ?plugins=... neu can), serve qua route /theme-assets/:slug/assets/tailwind.js co san trong themeAssets.ts. Ly do: dung thang domain ngoai bat buoc phai whitelist rieng trong CSP script-src (security.ts), quen whitelist se lam CSP chan sach script, mat toan bo style + "tailwind is not defined" (loi that da gap nhieu lan) - tu host loai bo hoan toan phu thuoc domain ngoai nay. PHAI giu {% block content %}{% endblock %} de noi dung tung trang chen vao, PHAI goi {% render "header", site: site, headerMenu: headerMenu %} va {% render "footer", site: site, footerMenu: footerMenu, year: year %}, PHAI giu {% render "components/common/breadcrumb", ... %} o trong layout de breadcrumb hien toan site khi route truyen breadcrumbs, PHAI goi {% render "components/common/cart-drawer" %} ngay truoc the dong body, PHAI giu the <link> toi /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.css va <script> toi .../custom.js (CSS/JS tuy bien rieng cua theme, sinh/sua o buoc khac). QUAN TRONG: neu goi them {% render "components/customer-chat" %}, PHAI truyen tay site: site, chatSessionId: chatSessionId, chatHmacToken: chatHmacToken - {% render %} cua LiquidJS co lap scope hoan toan (da kiem chung thuc te), KHONG tu ke thua bien global cua layout, thieu se lam avatar/session chat rong. Duoc tu do doi font (Google Fonts link), tailwind.config (mau sac, fontFamily), bo cuc <body> ngoai cac phan bat buoc tren.
{% endcomment %}

